- `crates/vox-compiler/src/typeck/checker/mod.rs`, `crates/vox-compiler/src/typeck/checker/expr.rs`, `crates/vox-compiler/src/typeck/checker/expr_ops.rs`:
    - Updated various type-checking call sites to use the new `with_code()` builder and attach the relevant stable diagnostic codes for common type errors (type mismatches, undefined variables, argument count/type mismatches, field/method not found).
- `crates/vox-code-audit/src/diagnostics/catalog.rs`:
    - Mirrored the 7 new stable type error codes from `vox-compiler` to allow `vox stub-check --explain` to serve explanations for them.
    - Added these new codes to `ALL_KNOWN_IDS`.
